---
import { servicesData } from '../data/services';
---

<section id="servicios" class="scroll-mt-20 sm:scroll-mt-24 py-20 sm:py-28 relative" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    
    <!-- Editorial Section Header -->
    <div class="border-t border-[#D9DED4] pt-8 sm:pt-12 mb-16 sm:mb-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#6F8F72] uppercase font-semibold mb-3">
          <span>02 — SERVICIOS Y SOLUCIONES</span>
        </div>
        <h2
          id="services-heading"
          class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#182019] tracking-tight leading-[1.12]"
        >
          Una web pensada<br />
          <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-[#263B2B]">
            para lo que necesitás<span class="text-[#6F8F72] not-italic">.</span>
          </span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 text-[#697069] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          No vendo paquetes enlatados ni aplico soluciones genéricas. Cada proyecto requiere un enfoque particular: desde una página directa para captar clientes hasta una plataforma completa con catálogo o agenda.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Rows Layout (No generic cards with icons) -->
    <div class="divide-y divide-[#D9DED4] border-y border-[#D9DED4]">
      {servicesData.map((service) => (
        <div
          class="group py-8 sm:py-10 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#FAFBF7] px-4 sm:px-6 -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 rounded-xl"
          data-interactive
        >
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8 items-start">
            
            <!-- Number & Primary Title -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex items-baseline gap-4 sm:gap-6">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6F8F72] font-semibold">
                {service.number}
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#182019] group-hover:text-[#263B2B] transition-colors">
                  {service.title}
                </h3>
                <span class="text-xs font-serif italic text-[#697069] block mt-1">
                  {service.subtitle}
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Description -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 pl-8 lg:pl-0">
              <p class="text-[#697069] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                {service.description}
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Tags & Indicator -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 pl-8 lg:pl-0 flex flex-wrap lg:flex-col lg:items-end justify-between gap-2">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 lg:justify-end">
                {service.tags.slice(0, 2).map((tag) => (
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#F4F5ED] text-[#182019] border border-[#D9DED4]">
                    {tag}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
              <span class="hidden lg:inline-flex text-xs font-mono text-[#6F8F72] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity transform group-hover:translate-x-1">
                Consultar ↗
              </span>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Conversation Link -->
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAFBF7] border border-[#D9DED4]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#182019]">¿No estás seguro de qué tipo de web necesita tu proyecto?</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#697069] mt-0.5">Podemos analizar juntos tu caso y definir la estructura ideal.</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#263B2B] text-[#F4F5ED] text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-[#182019]"
      >
        <span>Contame tu idea</span>
        <span class="text-[#A8BFA3]">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
